## Map Data and Basemap

The command map is rendered with MapLibre GL (via react-map-gl) using the
OpenFreeMap "dark" style served from `tiles.openfreemap.org`. The OpenFreeMap
style is MIT-licensed. The underlying map data is © OpenStreetMap contributors
and is licensed under the Open Database License
([ODbL](https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/)); attribution is surfaced
in-app through the MapLibre attribution control.

